  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8ab2da1d08f4fcb4380d1a1569c9ce14, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChatResponse_Wink
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _classType: 400
  _list:
  - _responseId: 0
    _responseFI: "Uskaltaako joku hyp\xE4t\xE4 peliin mun kanssa, vai pelk\xE4\xE4ttek\xF6
      h\xE4vi\xE4mist\xE4?"
    _responseEN: Does anyone have the guts to come play with me or are you afaid
      of losing to me?
  - _responseId: 1
    _responseFI: "Pelataanko toinen peli, vai ootteko jo v\xE4syneit\xE4 muhun?"
    _responseEN: Do you want to play another game or are you too tire of me?
  - _responseId: 2
    _responseFI: Voisin tulla, tai sitten olla tulematta
    _responseEN: I could come or then maybe I could not
  - _responseId: 3
    _responseFI: "Heitt\xE4k\xE4\xE4 mut soppaan, lupaan maustaa peli\xE4!"
    _responseEN: Throw me into the soup, I'll spice things up.
  - _responseId: 4
    _responseFI: "Ei, tai ehk\xE4 sittenki kyll\xE4!"
    _responseEN: No or maybe actually yes!
  - _responseId: 5
    _responseFI: "Ei, tai ehk\xE4 sittenkin kyll\xE4. No ei."
    _responseEN: No or maybe actually yes. Well... No.
  - _responseId: 6
    _responseFI: "Yo, yo, yo, miss\xE4 menn\xE4\xE4n?"
    _responseEN: Yo, yo, yo, whats going?
  - _responseId: 7
    _responseFI: "Hypp\xE4\xE4n pois nyt! Huomenna n\xE4hd\xE4\xE4n taas, ehk\xE4
      kuka tiet\xE4\xE4!"
    _responseEN: I'll be going now! May see you tomorrow, who knows.
  - _responseId: 8
    _responseFI: "Miss me while I\u2019m gone\u2026teen jotain salaper\xE4ist\xE4."
    _responseEN: "Miss me while I\u2019m gone\u2026 I'll be doing something secretive."
  - _responseId: 9
    _responseFI: "Se oli voitto, jonka j\xE4lkeen voitto, jonka j\xE4lkeen\u2026VOITTO!"
    _responseEN: It's a win, after which it's a win, after which... you guessed it...
      WIN!
  - _responseId: 10
    _responseFI: "H\xE4vi\xF6 on v\xE4\xE4rinp\xE4in voitto, joten me ei koskaan
      h\xE4vitty!"
    _responseEN: Loss is just reverse win, so we were never losing!
  - _responseId: 11
    _responseFI: "ALT Zone Discordi linkki, nettisivuilla. Noh, noh mit\xE4 viel\xE4
      vitkuttelet"
    _responseEN: ALT Zone Discord lisk is on the website. Well, what are you waiting
      for?
  - _responseId: 12
    _responseFI: "Vain kaiku vastaa, kun sille huudan. Miss\xE4 kaikki luuraa?"
    _responseEN: Only hte echo answers when I yell. Where is everybody?
  - _responseId: 13
    _responseFI: "Nyt t\xE4ytyy antaa kyll\xE4 t\xE4ydet pisteet ja papukaijamerkki
      t\xE4n pelin tekij\xF6ille!"
    _responseEN: Now I have to give full points and an applause to this games creators.
  - _responseId: 14
    _responseFI: "N\xE4kev\xE4tk\xF6 silm\xE4ni oikein..? Viimeisen\xE4 maaliin p\xF6rh\xE4lt\xE4\xE4,
      t\xE4m\xE4 peli!"
    _responseEN: Am I seeing things...? Last across the line is... this game!
  - _responseId: 15
    _responseFI: "Ent\xE4s jos, sin\xE4 opetat, ja min\xE4 katson, hehe."
    _responseEN: How about... you teach how it's done and I'll take notes.
